## Input

```css
@media (aspect-ratio: 16 / 9) and (min-width: calc(800px - 16px)) {
  .query { color: red; }
}

@font-face {
  font-family: serif;
  src: url(font.woff2);
}

.grid {
  grid-template-columns: [first start] 1fr [end];
  --tokens: [first end];
  &__bar { color: blue; }
}

@unknown fn(#{$value});

```


